<title>GREECE: TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, AUG 13.</title>
<headline>TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, AUG 13.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Greece's fixing rates for leading currencies on Wednesday were as follows.</p>
<p>------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> Currency:	Aug 13	Aug 12   Dec 31 96    CHANGE</p>
<p>								 FROM YR-END</p>
<p>------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>- USD =	  290.510     290.920     247.020    17.61 %</p>
<p>- ECU =	  308.320     307.800     306.830     0.49 %</p>
<p>- DEM =	  157.025     156.400     158.970    -1.22 %</p>
<p>- FRF =	   46.570	46.422	47.182    -1.30 %</p>
<p>- GBP =	  456.940     461.700     419.180     9.01 %</p>
<p>- NLG =	  139.440     138.840     141.685    -1.58 %</p>
<p>- ITL (100) =   16.045	16.022	16.185    -0.86 %</p>
<p>- JPY (100) =  249.460     250.970     212.430    17.43 %</p>
<p>- ESP =	    1.860	 1.853	1.8880    -1.48 %</p>
<p>- PTE =	    1.550	 1.543	1.5810    -1.96 %</p>
<p>- CHF =	  190.845     190.680     183.135     4.21 %</p>
<p>Note: The net change is calculated as the percentage difference between the most recent fixing rate and the December 31, 1996 rate.</p>
<p>--Angelos Kiosklis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
